English
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

All rights to the contents of this repository are reserved by the author. This
includes the source code, the character designs and the scripts that generate
them, the documentation, the research reports, and the images.

**No license is granted.**

You may not copy, modify, redistribute, or use any of it commercially, except
as permitted to you by the GitHub Terms of Service (viewing and forking this
repository).

This repository is public so that the process of building the project can be
read, not because the contents are free to use. To request permission, please
open an issue in this repository.

The characters and their visual style are original works, created without using
the identifying elements of any existing character.

The research reports under docs/research/ quote publicly available documents
from Apple, KDDI, NTT DOCOMO, OpenAI, Google, the Japanese Agency for Cultural
Affairs and others, with their source URLs. Rights to those quoted passages
remain with their respective holders.
